WEBVTT

00:00:07.841 --> 00:00:10.260
You guys should be the ones to leave!

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:12.596
We're the official Library Club members,

00:00:12.596 --> 00:00:16.558
and you guys are the ones doing
unrelated stuff here on your own.

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:17.809
But...

00:00:17.809 --> 00:00:20.854
Will those who aren't qualified
for membership please leave?

00:00:20.854 --> 00:00:22.481
Oh, right.

00:00:24.274 --> 00:00:27.152
These are in the way, so get rid of them.

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:29.404
And this, too!

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:30.614
Don't touch me!

00:00:30.614 --> 00:00:31.782
You bastards!

00:00:31.782 --> 00:00:33.242
Don't, Takamine!

00:00:33.242 --> 00:00:35.035
Get out! C'mon, get out!

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:39.122
Get out! Get out! Get out! Get out!

00:00:49.883 --> 00:00:52.636
<i>Writing down my aspirations</i>

00:00:52.636 --> 00:00:55.389
<i>For the day when they will come true</i>

00:00:55.389 --> 00:01:00.727
<i>The time has come when</i>
<i>I want to turn to the page I marked</i>

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:06.191
<i>Although there are things I lose</i>
<i>sight of with everything that happens</i>

00:01:06.191 --> 00:01:07.568
<i>Hey, it's all right</i>

00:01:07.568 --> 00:01:11.488
<i>The start I'm embarking on is unexpected</i>

00:01:11.488 --> 00:01:14.324
<i>The memory that you couldn't erase</i>

00:01:14.324 --> 00:01:16.994
<i>Even that sad memory</i>

00:01:16.994 --> 00:01:21.039
<i>I'll give it a different, happier reading</i>

00:01:21.039 --> 00:01:26.670
<i>I feel like just that will change everything</i>

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:27.796
<i>All Right</i>

00:01:27.796 --> 00:01:31.008
<i>So come now, the way you are!</i>

00:01:31.008 --> 00:01:33.844
<i>Don't hide your weak self</i>

00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:34.845
<i>On my Sheep </i>

00:01:34.845 --> 00:01:38.515
<i>Let's meet riding on a dream</i>

00:01:38.515 --> 00:01:44.438
<i>Even just calling your name as</i>
<i>I write in this book of adventures</i>

00:01:44.438 --> 00:01:47.274
<i>I'm not lost anymore</i>

00:01:47.274 --> 00:01:50.986
<i>Let's start our journey together</i>

00:01:50.986 --> 00:01:58.744
<i>Yes... more of you and me!</i>

00:02:10.172 --> 00:02:11.048
"Episode 11: Decision"
I hate to say it,

00:02:11.048 --> 00:02:14.134
"Episode 11: Decision"
but they've got logic on their side.

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:15.928
We've been allowed to continue
our activities at the library

00:02:15.928 --> 00:02:18.639
thanks to the good will
of the head library worker,

00:02:18.639 --> 00:02:21.767
but it's not like we've
received official permission.

00:02:21.767 --> 00:02:25.646
It looks like the Library Club
has returned to what it should be.

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:32.528
Don't tell me this is <i>your </i>doing?

00:02:32.528 --> 00:02:37.950
I was just helping the guys who were in a fix
because their clubroom had been taken over.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:39.368
It's the opposite, isn't it?

00:02:39.368 --> 00:02:43.288
Without someone to incite them,
they would have stayed inactive forever.

00:02:43.288 --> 00:02:45.832
They wouldn't have come back now.

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:47.584
Do you have proof?

00:02:47.584 --> 00:02:49.336
Bastard...

00:02:51.004 --> 00:02:53.298
Do you know what a Shepherd is?

00:02:57.511 --> 00:03:00.722
"You will reach even greater heights by facing
off with the Library Club. From the Shepherd"

00:03:08.605 --> 00:03:13.068
I hear that Shepherds lead
people to their ideal futures.

00:03:13.068 --> 00:03:18.240
All I want is to make
this school a better place.

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.742
What is up with that vice president?!

00:03:20.742 --> 00:03:23.829
She was totally trying to pick a fight!

00:03:24.913 --> 00:03:27.124
Kana, calm down.

00:03:29.877 --> 00:03:34.840
I'll never forgive them. I won't let
guys like that take our room away!

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:37.092
But it's just a clubroom.

00:03:37.885 --> 00:03:42.598
We're all still together. Isn't that enough?

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:48.353
You said it!

00:03:48.353 --> 00:03:49.646
What?

00:03:51.523 --> 00:03:54.151
We have to make Minafes a success!

00:03:54.151 --> 00:03:56.653
It'll all be over if we give up now.

00:03:56.653 --> 00:04:01.074
There's no way we can let things
go the way that vice president wants!

00:04:01.074 --> 00:04:03.076
Who's unqualified for membership?!

00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:05.787
We can continue the
Happy Project wherever we are!

00:04:05.787 --> 00:04:08.957
It's not like we've stopped being friends!

00:04:08.957 --> 00:04:10.292
We'll show her!

00:04:12.252 --> 00:04:15.964
--All right!
--Let's do it!

00:04:31.438 --> 00:04:34.525
I didn't think Takigawa would
have a Shepherd working with her.

00:04:34.525 --> 00:04:39.905
It's the first I've heard of it, too. I asked
Kodachi last night, but she didn't know either.

00:04:39.905 --> 00:04:41.031
"Last night"?!

00:04:41.031 --> 00:04:42.991
It's nothing to worry about.

00:04:42.991 --> 00:04:47.871
Kodachi said it might not
even really be from a Shepherd.

00:04:47.871 --> 00:04:49.122
Kodachi...

00:04:49.122 --> 00:04:51.124
Hey, Kakei!

00:04:54.294 --> 00:04:57.881
There are some strange guys in your clubroom...

00:04:57.881 --> 00:04:59.675
I explained last night, didn't I?

00:04:59.675 --> 00:05:01.051
You did?

00:05:01.051 --> 00:05:02.469
Oh, right!

00:05:02.469 --> 00:05:05.556
Kakei, what do you want for dinner tonight?

00:05:06.765 --> 00:05:10.519
K-Kakei is busy right now. Please ask him later!

00:05:11.270 --> 00:05:14.815
Oh yeah, if Kakei and
I become Shepherds together,

00:05:14.815 --> 00:05:18.652
we could take care of your Minafes
something or other problem in a second.

00:05:19.278 --> 00:05:20.445
Kodachi!

00:05:20.445 --> 00:05:22.197
Nooo!

00:05:22.197 --> 00:05:24.408
Kakei, Shirasaki!

00:05:24.408 --> 00:05:25.409
Hey.

00:05:25.409 --> 00:05:26.827
Tamamo?

00:05:26.827 --> 00:05:28.453
The student council is...

00:05:31.123 --> 00:05:32.165
"Shiomi Academy Student Council Web"
This is...

00:05:32.165 --> 00:05:34.001
"Symposium Thinking About"
...sponsored by the student council?

00:05:34.001 --> 00:05:36.712
"the Future of Shiomi Academy"
The time and date are the same as Minafes...

00:05:36.712 --> 00:05:39.548
What's with all the
people that are appearing...?

00:05:39.548 --> 00:05:41.633
They're all super famous.

00:05:41.633 --> 00:05:44.178
They're all alum of the school.

00:05:44.178 --> 00:05:48.390
The concept seems to be a conversation
between graduates and current students.

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:51.768
Honestly, to get all these
people together in one place...

00:05:51.768 --> 00:05:55.939
Publicity... We need to keep getting the
word out and get people to come to Minafes...

00:05:59.693 --> 00:06:00.569
What's wrong?

00:06:00.569 --> 00:06:03.155
People want to return their tickets...

00:06:03.155 --> 00:06:04.406
What?!

00:06:11.496 --> 00:06:13.040
Shirasaki!

00:06:14.082 --> 00:06:15.125
Yes?

00:06:15.125 --> 00:06:19.129
Uh, does anyone have any ideas?

00:06:20.255 --> 00:06:22.007
Maybe if we tried going to
different places to publicize...

00:06:22.007 --> 00:06:23.300
Just now...

00:06:23.300 --> 00:06:27.346
Don't tell me... at Minafes, Shirasaki will...

00:06:29.056 --> 00:06:31.141
Should I tell everyone?

00:06:31.141 --> 00:06:36.647
But if I do, Minafes
itself might be cancelled...

00:06:37.564 --> 00:06:40.734
No! I can stop it...

00:06:40.734 --> 00:06:42.152
"Mixed Sandwich" "Plum" "Cod roe"

00:06:42.361 --> 00:06:45.322
I have that power...

00:06:46.823 --> 00:06:49.701
I went through all the trouble
of preparing it, but you won't eat it?

00:06:49.701 --> 00:06:51.578
That makes me sad...

00:06:52.788 --> 00:06:54.081
Sorry.

00:06:54.081 --> 00:06:57.417
What? It's no fun if you just apologize.

00:06:58.460 --> 00:06:59.378
Kodachi...

00:06:59.378 --> 00:07:00.671
What is it?

00:07:00.671 --> 00:07:03.715
I'm thinking of becoming a Shepherd.

00:07:03.715 --> 00:07:05.759
Oh?

00:07:05.759 --> 00:07:07.219
What?!

00:07:07.219 --> 00:07:09.471
I think this is the path
I should take, after all.

00:07:09.471 --> 00:07:11.139
You'll be forgotten, you know.

00:07:11.139 --> 00:07:14.059
Everything, even the fact
that you existed, will be forgotten!

00:07:14.059 --> 00:07:16.645
Shirasaki's life is at stake.

00:07:17.771 --> 00:07:21.441
Anyway, even the fact that I started
thinking that I didn't want to be forgotten

00:07:21.441 --> 00:07:23.694
was thanks to them.

00:07:35.664 --> 00:07:38.000
This is how it'll turn out after all, huh?

00:07:38.959 --> 00:07:42.087
You know what the boss told me?

00:07:42.087 --> 00:07:47.092
He said that only one of us
could become a Shepherd.

00:07:48.802 --> 00:07:52.973
That's why I wanted to get in your way.

00:07:53.557 --> 00:07:57.769
I sent you messages and
had you form the Library Club,

00:07:57.769 --> 00:08:03.567
thinking that if you got together with one
of them, you wouldn't become a Shepherd.

00:08:04.526 --> 00:08:06.195
Is that how it was?

00:08:06.195 --> 00:08:10.115
But I'm still a Shepherd,
even if I'm a sorry excuse for one.

00:08:10.115 --> 00:08:14.077
I didn't choose a future
where you would be unhappy.

00:08:15.037 --> 00:08:16.997
Even if you got together with
someone from the Library Club,

00:08:16.997 --> 00:08:18.999
you would be able to have a happy life.

00:08:18.999 --> 00:08:20.501
Thinking that, I...

00:08:20.501 --> 00:08:23.420
Yeah. Sorry...

00:08:25.297 --> 00:08:28.592
Oh, you idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

00:08:28.592 --> 00:08:31.470
Well, let's go then!

00:08:31.470 --> 00:08:32.888
'Kay.

00:08:47.945 --> 00:08:49.905
You've decided, then?

00:08:49.905 --> 00:08:53.951
I don't want to be like my father.

00:08:54.993 --> 00:08:59.373
When I wanted him to help me most,
he didn't do anything for me.

00:08:59.373 --> 00:09:01.166
But I'm different...

00:09:01.166 --> 00:09:05.087
If there's a way for me to save someone,
then that's what I want to choose.

00:09:05.879 --> 00:09:09.341
I truly respect your decision.

00:09:13.887 --> 00:09:16.056
This is your book.

00:09:16.056 --> 00:09:19.184
I will now erase it...

00:09:35.117 --> 00:09:40.247
Goodbye, everyone... Goodbye, Shirasaki...

00:09:42.416 --> 00:09:45.919
I thought this during
Kakei's birthday, you know?

00:09:45.919 --> 00:09:49.798
That we could do anything
as long as Kakei was with us.

00:09:49.798 --> 00:09:51.341
Yeah, that's true.

00:09:51.341 --> 00:09:54.052
At the time, Kakei said...

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:01.393
Huh? I can't remember...

00:10:01.393 --> 00:10:08.650
Um... Wait, I forgot, too...
Well, it <i>was </i>almost two months ago.

00:10:08.650 --> 00:10:10.527
No! No!

00:10:10.527 --> 00:10:12.571
It's something I can't forget!

00:10:12.571 --> 00:10:13.864
Why?

00:10:16.491 --> 00:10:18.660
Don't tell me... Kakei...

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:19.745
Shirasaki?

00:10:19.745 --> 00:10:21.914
Hello? Shirasaki?

00:10:21.914 --> 00:10:24.416
Kakei is going to disappear!

00:10:28.086 --> 00:10:30.589
Shirasaki! Hey, Shirasaki!

00:10:44.561 --> 00:10:47.648
Oh good, you're here, Kakei...

00:10:47.648 --> 00:10:50.442
Shirasaki... what's wrong?

00:10:53.237 --> 00:10:56.073
It's strange...

00:10:56.073 --> 00:11:01.203
I've been having a hard time
remembering our conversations, Kakei...

00:11:02.037 --> 00:11:06.083
I feel like I'll forget
everything at this rate...

00:11:09.503 --> 00:11:12.673
Kakei... Don't tell me...

00:11:12.673 --> 00:11:15.425
Naw, you're overthinking it, Shirasaki.

00:11:15.425 --> 00:11:17.386
Anyway, come in.

00:11:22.808 --> 00:11:24.101
Liar...

00:11:24.101 --> 00:11:25.853
What?!

00:11:27.229 --> 00:11:30.482
They're precious memories! Memories with you!

00:11:30.482 --> 00:11:32.526
There's no way I'd forget them!

00:11:32.526 --> 00:11:33.610
C'mon, Kakei, please!

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:38.824
Tell me the truth. Kakei!

00:11:38.824 --> 00:11:40.617
Shirasaki...

00:12:11.690 --> 00:12:14.985
It's something I've been
thinking about for a long time.

00:12:14.985 --> 00:12:20.032
I've yearned for the magic library
with the Shepherds since I was little.

00:12:20.032 --> 00:12:23.368
That's why it was a good opportunity.

00:12:31.752 --> 00:12:33.337
Take me with you.

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:36.465
Please...

00:12:40.427 --> 00:12:47.976
If you become a Shepherd, everyone will
forget you. Can you let that happen, Shirasaki?

00:12:50.646 --> 00:12:53.190
Are you okay with it, Kakei?

00:12:53.190 --> 00:12:54.358
Of course not.

00:12:54.358 --> 00:12:55.442
Then--!

00:12:55.442 --> 00:12:56.902
There's something I want to check.

00:12:56.902 --> 00:13:04.201
If I can really make someone happy,
then that loneliness and despair...

00:13:04.201 --> 00:13:07.621
I can prove that it wasn't for nothing.

00:13:07.621 --> 00:13:11.625
If you can't be happy
without becoming a Shepherd,

00:13:11.625 --> 00:13:16.129
then you didn't really believe
in the Happy Project, did you?

00:13:18.465 --> 00:13:20.676
I hate Shepherds.

00:13:23.178 --> 00:13:26.682
I hate the Kakei that became
a Shepherd even more...

00:13:34.815 --> 00:13:38.277
This was for the best...

00:13:40.112 --> 00:13:44.783
I will disappear from
Shirasaki's memories one day.

00:13:44.783 --> 00:13:48.787
If that's the case, then it'll
be less painful if she hates me...

00:13:49.454 --> 00:13:53.458
Anyway, I have to find a way
to save Shirasaki right now.

00:13:57.713 --> 00:13:58.547
Yes?

00:13:58.547 --> 00:14:00.507
Kakei! There's trouble!

00:14:00.507 --> 00:14:02.634
Senri's... Senri's...!

00:14:05.596 --> 00:14:07.556
Misono, Kanasuke?

00:14:07.556 --> 00:14:09.141
Kakei...

00:14:09.141 --> 00:14:10.642
What's wrong?

00:14:15.147 --> 00:14:17.566
Good morning, Kakei.

00:14:17.566 --> 00:14:20.152
How are you feeling today?

00:14:20.152 --> 00:14:21.945
M-Misono?

00:14:24.364 --> 00:14:28.452
Oh no, that needs to be dealt with immediately.

00:14:28.452 --> 00:14:30.245
Now, lie down...

00:14:32.206 --> 00:14:33.874
What's going on?

00:14:34.833 --> 00:14:40.172
Where does it hurt? Here? Or <i>here</i>?

00:14:40.172 --> 00:14:41.882
H-Hey, wait a minute!

00:14:41.882 --> 00:14:44.593
I got a phone call from
Kanasuke saying you were in trouble...

00:14:44.593 --> 00:14:46.011
Kana's here, you know.

00:14:46.011 --> 00:14:47.346
What?

00:14:53.060 --> 00:14:55.354
You called, Kakei?

00:14:55.354 --> 00:14:56.772
K-Kanasuke...?

00:14:56.772 --> 00:14:59.858
He said just one wasn't enough...

00:14:59.858 --> 00:15:04.112
Oh Kakei, you're so dirty!

00:15:04.112 --> 00:15:06.615
How many girls have you made cry so far?

00:15:06.615 --> 00:15:08.033
You need to be punished.

00:15:08.033 --> 00:15:10.994
What shall we punish first?

00:15:10.994 --> 00:15:12.538
Stop it!

00:15:14.206 --> 00:15:15.415
My eyes!

00:15:15.415 --> 00:15:17.835
Y-You guys, what are you doing?

00:15:17.835 --> 00:15:22.840
Kana said in order to stop a man from leaving,
we had to use our feminine charms...

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:24.049
That's strange...

00:15:24.049 --> 00:15:27.553
I saw on the Internet
that men liked stuff like this...

00:15:27.553 --> 00:15:29.388
What site were you looking at?

00:15:30.389 --> 00:15:32.516
Wait, stop from leaving? Who?

00:15:32.516 --> 00:15:35.060
You, of course.

00:15:35.060 --> 00:15:36.603
Me?

00:15:38.564 --> 00:15:39.439
Hello?

00:15:39.439 --> 00:15:42.150
Kakei! What is the meaning of this?!

00:15:42.150 --> 00:15:42.860
Huh?

00:15:42.860 --> 00:15:45.112
Come to Appllio immediately!

00:15:47.197 --> 00:15:50.993
This morning, we all got this message!

00:15:53.287 --> 00:15:56.915
"Kakei Kyotaro has sold his
body to the student council"...?

00:15:56.915 --> 00:15:59.918
"He has joined the student
council on the condition that

00:15:59.918 --> 00:16:04.798
Minafes be recognized
as an official school event."

00:16:04.798 --> 00:16:06.341
Don't do something like that on your own!

00:16:06.341 --> 00:16:09.011
And of all things, to sell
your body to the student council...

00:16:09.011 --> 00:16:11.555
--Idiot, idiot, idiot, idiot!
--Uh... wait...

00:16:11.555 --> 00:16:13.640
I won't let you go to the student council.

00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:16.101
Give up on Mochizuki!

00:16:16.101 --> 00:16:18.520
No, it's a misunderstanding!

00:16:18.520 --> 00:16:19.354
Sorry!

00:16:19.354 --> 00:16:24.109
--We're so useless that you had to taint yourself!
--Uh, no, it's...

00:16:27.362 --> 00:16:33.160
--Kakei, sorry!
--Oh, Shirasaki! You talk to this guy, too!

00:16:33.160 --> 00:16:35.412
I said, you've got it all wrong!

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:39.875
I'm not going to join the student council.

00:16:39.875 --> 00:16:43.629
It's probably just a fake message from Takigawa.

00:16:43.629 --> 00:16:47.216
You mean we were
completely taken in by her, huh?

00:16:48.842 --> 00:16:53.180
But because of what happened,
I realized something.

00:16:53.680 --> 00:16:56.767
I realized what's most important.

00:16:56.767 --> 00:16:59.436
Each and every one of us is necessary!

00:17:00.312 --> 00:17:01.480
Yeah.

00:17:01.480 --> 00:17:03.398
Yeah, that's right!

00:17:03.398 --> 00:17:08.362
Because all of us together make
the Happy Project. Right, Shirasaki?!

00:17:08.362 --> 00:17:09.655
Huh?

00:17:09.655 --> 00:17:11.281
R-Right...

00:17:20.165 --> 00:17:20.999
No luck?

00:17:20.999 --> 00:17:24.253
No, I have to look in a different book.

00:17:28.215 --> 00:17:29.883
Kakei.

00:17:29.883 --> 00:17:32.469
Misono, why are you here?

00:17:32.469 --> 00:17:35.806
I saw you climb up here just now...

00:17:35.806 --> 00:17:37.933
Did you need me for something?

00:17:37.933 --> 00:17:43.021
Kakei, please let me sing on stage for Minafes.

00:17:43.021 --> 00:17:45.816
What? Really?

00:17:45.816 --> 00:17:48.485
I don't have anything
except my singing, after all.

00:17:48.485 --> 00:17:53.240
Not for anyone else's sake,
but for you all, I feel like I can sing...

00:17:53.240 --> 00:17:56.702
No, I <i>want </i>to sing again. That's how I feel.

00:17:56.702 --> 00:17:59.079
I see. Thanks.

00:18:00.497 --> 00:18:04.293
Were you able to see a
future where this happened?

00:18:04.293 --> 00:18:07.838
No, this is a path you've
chosen for yourself, Misono.

00:18:07.838 --> 00:18:08.839
Kakei...

00:18:10.465 --> 00:18:12.426
Please close your eyes.

00:18:39.953 --> 00:18:41.121
"Journalism Club"
"Web News Editing Room"

00:18:41.121 --> 00:18:42.873
Minafes, huh?

00:18:42.873 --> 00:18:46.293
Where all the puny clubs are
getting together to do something?

00:18:46.293 --> 00:18:48.754
But I think you should
write an article about it.

00:18:48.754 --> 00:18:50.380
I wonder...

00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:54.676
I heard that the Song Princess,
Senri Misono, would be singing.

00:18:54.676 --> 00:18:57.596
Oh? Senri Misono...

00:18:57.596 --> 00:19:01.558
Huh? Senri Misono?! Really?

00:19:01.558 --> 00:19:03.727
Hm? Huh?

00:19:03.769 --> 00:19:04.561
"Legendary Song Princess to Appear at Minafes!"

00:19:04.561 --> 00:19:06.313
What? The Song Princess is?

00:19:06.313 --> 00:19:09.399
That's amazing! I'm looking forward to it!

00:19:09.399 --> 00:19:10.943
Misono...

00:19:11.026 --> 00:19:12.277
"Shiomi Academy Journalism Club News"

00:19:12.277 --> 00:19:14.821
Misono, is it true?

00:19:14.821 --> 00:19:18.867
I don't know how people
found out about it, but yes, it's true.

00:19:18.867 --> 00:19:19.993
It's okay, then?

00:19:19.993 --> 00:19:24.331
It's fine. Just make sure you
do some down and dirty publicity.

00:19:26.542 --> 00:19:28.377
Senri!

00:19:29.878 --> 00:19:32.506
Kana, sorry to make you worry.

00:19:34.591 --> 00:19:38.887
After everyone's worked so hard,
we definitely can't let it go to waste!

00:19:39.263 --> 00:19:42.057
Happy Project, fight!

00:19:42.057 --> 00:19:49.314
--Fight! Fight! Fight!
--Fight! Fight!

00:19:52.693 --> 00:19:55.404
Miyu Serizawa's After School Avenue!

00:19:55.404 --> 00:20:00.742
Our special guests today are the
hottest heroines of Shiomi Academy,

00:20:00.742 --> 00:20:04.246
Tsugumi Shirasaki and Senri Misono.

00:20:04.246 --> 00:20:08.208
It looks like you're up against
the student council's event.

00:20:08.208 --> 00:20:12.254
Oh, I think their event is
also very worthwhile to attend.

00:20:12.254 --> 00:20:14.590
However, we will also work hard.

00:20:14.590 --> 00:20:16.800
And Misono, you will be singing?

00:20:16.800 --> 00:20:21.847
Yes, I promise to give a performance
even better than the entrance ceremony.

00:20:25.017 --> 00:20:27.811
Miyu, I have a favor to ask you.

00:20:28.103 --> 00:20:30.105
"Announcing Miyu Serizawa as MC for Minafes!"

00:20:30.230 --> 00:20:32.608
At least do your best.

00:20:32.608 --> 00:20:35.402
The more you all struggle,

00:20:35.402 --> 00:20:39.573
the more that will prove me right in the end.

00:20:45.245 --> 00:20:49.499
"Everyone! We, the Happy Project..."

00:20:50.542 --> 00:20:53.420
"We, the Happy Project--"

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:55.047
No, that's not right...

00:20:55.047 --> 00:20:58.258
"We! The Happy Project!"

00:21:00.636 --> 00:21:03.639
"Schedule for the Day Before and Day Of"

00:21:23.325 --> 00:21:24.868
Kakei's...

00:21:24.868 --> 00:21:27.287
...an <i>idiot</i>!

00:21:27.871 --> 00:21:29.623
It's no use!

00:21:31.792 --> 00:21:34.962
I can't change it...

00:21:34.962 --> 00:21:37.089
At this rate...

00:21:37.089 --> 00:21:39.758
At this rate, Shirasaki will...

00:21:51.353 --> 00:22:00.070
<i>The starting bell, the sound of a lock</i>

00:22:00.070 --> 00:22:07.786
<i>While drifting aimlessly, I become an adult</i>

00:22:07.786 --> 00:22:17.629
<i>The time has come when days spent</i>
<i>running and playing seem far away</i>

00:22:17.629 --> 00:22:21.884
<i>The answer I gave here</i>

00:22:21.884 --> 00:22:34.813
<i>Oh, if only it had been</i>
<i>passed down somewhere</i>

00:22:34.813 --> 00:22:39.610
<i>For those crowds walking around lost</i>

00:22:39.610 --> 00:22:43.947
<i>It can be a light that shines on them</i>

00:22:43.947 --> 00:22:52.247
<i>On the other side of the</i>
<i>green belt that surrounds us</i>

00:22:52.247 --> 00:23:00.631
<i>You head toward endless tomorrows</i>

00:23:12.017 --> 00:23:12.976
"Right Before Minafes Special"

00:23:12.976 --> 00:23:16.188
Today, let's hear everyone's
thoughts about Minafes!

00:23:16.188 --> 00:23:18.607
We've taken no shortcuts in our
preparations, so all that's left is to do it!

00:23:18.607 --> 00:23:21.109
I put a lot of effort into writing the script!

00:23:21.109 --> 00:23:22.861
I want to sing so badly, I can't sit still!

00:23:22.861 --> 00:23:24.029
Excited.

00:23:24.029 --> 00:23:27.491
Let's all become happy together!
Oh, we're out of time!

00:23:27.491 --> 00:23:29.826
Wait a minute! I stayed up
all night to think of this line...

00:23:29.826 --> 00:23:31.453
Forget that.

00:23:31.453 --> 00:23:32.079
Minafes is waiting for you!

00:23:32.079 --> 00:23:34.414
"Next time: A Good Librarian Like a Good Shepherd"
Minafes is waiting for you!

00:23:34.414 --> 00:23:37.125
"Next time: A Good Librarian Like a Good Shepherd"
You!
